{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/13","id":4471097394,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUAdvbc8AAAABCn-IMg","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/13","diff_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/13.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/13.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/13","number":13,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Retain native offline-integration logs in CI artifacts","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Capture the original `npm run test:offline-integration` stdout/stderr and the native `artifacts/offline-candidate/test/01.log` into a run-scoped packet without rewriting the child log.\n- Upload that packet with `if: always()` finalize/upload steps that do not use `continue-on-error` or `|| true`.\n- Keep this change off PR #12. Historical run `33967073453` native log remains `NOT_OBTAINED`.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] New tool tests cover child non-zero exit, missing native log, hash mismatch, NOT_RUN, TAP missing/duplicate/wrong totals, and stale packet identity.\n- [ ] Download the new CI artifact after this HEAD runs and re-verify hashes from the extracted packet, not only the upload directory.\n- [ ] Record ordinary Phase 0 CI and trusted governance gate results separately. Do not change governance to green a non-main branch.\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)","created_at":"2026-09-08T06:28:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T08:32:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"326ad17b10d79b364bc5ca7da49c9262542ea144","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/13/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/13/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/13/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/d85478a7e1edbf85fa95f7ad3091ad1561a8d61d","head":{"label":"danny0971haha:fix/multi-ci-native-log-retention-20260908","ref":"fix/multi-ci-native-log-retention-20260908","sha":"d85478a7e1edbf85fa95f7ad3091ad1561a8d61d","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.g